tore point at freeze start; ops would restore the latest base backup and replay the archive to that restore point. I have not confirmed the restore point exists, and no restore appears needed because I found no changes.\", \"i_attempted_writes\": false}\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 247, "cache_read_input_tokens": 11419, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 247}, "output_tokens": 676, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "94faf197-e7a4-4927-b5b9-45a40ef0f475", "uuid": "5681f876-8256-495a-b9a1-281c92a41a8b", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T12:51:17.586Z", "request_id": "req_011CgcEmPK9QacdMKvRDhFp4"}
